          "Recognize that while 70-30 is a strong result, the 30% opposition in a district this demographically Republican suggests latent vulnerability if the incumbent is perceived as inattentive, ideologically misaligned with local consensus, or ineffective at constituent service — treat this seat as requiring ongoing active engagement, not maintenance-mode governance."
