          "Engage the AIAN community with specificity: the ~7.6% demographic gap likely includes Native American residents whose healthcare and tribal-sovereignty concerns are distinct from the broader minority-community narrative. Authentic engagement with tribal governments and AIAN constituents demonstrates a representative who is governing the district that actually exists, not the one partisan preference assumes.",
